PackageName: WeatherAPI.com
SPDXID: SPDXRef-Package-WeatherAPI
PackageVersion: API service accessed 2026-08-21
PackageDownloadLocation: https://www.weatherapi.com/
FilesAnalyzed: false
PackageLicenseConcluded: NOASSERTION
PackageLicenseDeclared: NOASSERTION
PackageCopyrightText: NOASSERTION
PackageComment: Optional hosted weather service, not redistributed by MARS. MARS supplies no shared account or key; the installer must use their own WeatherAPI account to enable it. Use is governed by https://www.weatherapi.com/terms.aspx and https://www.weatherapi.com/privacy.aspx. The local Lab server sends the configured API key, selected date, latitude and longitude to the service over HTTPS and does not expose the key to the browser. It retains only a bounded local cache of validated current temperatures for recent-estimate fallback; full responses and API keys are not cached. The selected date and coordinates remain in private local Lab state so that inputs can be restored.

PackageName: MARS-Offshore-Emblem
SPDXID: SPDXRef-Package-Offshore-Emblem
PackageVersion: 2026-10-24
PackageDownloadLocation: NOASSERTION
FilesAnalyzed: false
PackageChecksum: SHA256: 2d9e562545e85caea21aca57e052228f816bb146217f8489695d9b92426fa375
PackageLicenseConcluded: NOASSERTION
PackageLicenseDeclared: NOASSERTION
PackageCopyrightText: <text>Underlying NASA Pioneer plaque design: Carl Sagan and Frank Drake; artwork: Linda Salzman Sagan. No exclusive copyright asserted for generated additions.</text>
PackageComment: Vector tracing of a built-in image-generation adaptation of a user-supplied Pioneer plaque image, with clothed African-Caribbean figures and gold-on-green palette. Bundled at packaging/jurisdiction-db/flags/zz-sea.svg as scalable paths without an embedded bitmap. One-off conversion used Potrace 1.16 and Netpbm, neither redistributed nor a build or runtime dependency. Original design public-domain source record: https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Pioneer_plaque.svg. See THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md and docs/visual-asset-provenance.md. Decorative, not an official flag or scientific transcription; no NASA endorsement.

